91
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,270
Ayahanda kau sendiri,

92
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,710
Marquis Jingyuan,

93
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:40,350
yang ingkar perintah tentera,

94
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,440
punca puluhan ribu
perajurit terkorban.

95
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:43,910
Rupanya begitu kisahnya.

96
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,590
Kenapa seluruh keluarganya tak dihukum mati?

97
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,200
Kamu dua beradik

98
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,830
patut bersyukur
beta rayu pada Baginda

99
00:04:49,830 --> 00:04:51,150
ampunkan keluarga kau
dan Kediaman Marquis.

100
00:04:52,190 --> 00:04:54,120
Namun kau berani ganggu
upacara perasmian ini.

101
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,640
Ibu bapa kau jeneral memalukan.

102
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:56,910
Dan anak mereka pula?

103
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,950
Seorang perancang licik,

104
00:04:59,830 --> 00:05:01,030
