105
00:05:01,870 --> 00:05:03,190
Kedua-duanya tak tahu berterima kasih,

106
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:04,150
tiada adab mahupun budi pekerti.

107
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,590
Beta syak kamu datang hari ini

108
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,320
dengan niat menderhaka.

109
00:05:11,390 --> 00:05:11,910
Tangkap mereka!

110
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:17,590
Mari lihat siapa berani sentuh mereka.

111
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:21,320
Siapa itu?

112
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:26,880
Siapa pula orang ini?

113
00:05:27,410 --> 00:05:28,100
Aku tak kenal dia.

114
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,590
Siapakah wanita itu?

115
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:48,470
Dia bukan perancang licik.

116
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:49,760
Bertahun-tahun ini,

117
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,080
dia memikul beban
tuduhan palsu ibu bapanya,

118
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,200
mempertahankan Kediaman Marquis,

119
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:55,080
