124
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,510
Dan dia bukan pemalas leka.

125
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:07,120
Dia belajar jadi penyiasat mayat
demi membongkar kebenaran,

126
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:08,910
