orang ramai akan mengejeknya.

127
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,510
Dia jauh lebih berani

128
00:06:12,090 --> 00:06:13,450
berbanding orang sepertimu
yang berundur tanpa melawan.

129
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:15,390
Bagaimana kamu berdua masih hidup?

130
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:16,950
Tuanku,

131
00:06:16,950 --> 00:06:17,880
kata-kata itu tidak begitu bijak.

132
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:19,880
Semua yang tuanku sangka dah mati

133
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:21,270
muncul pada hari ini.

134
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,760
Terkejut?
Tak sangka langsung, bukan?

135
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,270
Sanqi, Cangzhu.

136
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:51,430
Kami serahkan urusan di sini kepada kalian.

137
00:06:51,430 --> 00:06:53,080
Sebarkan berita
bahawa kami memalsukan kematian.

138
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,880
Biarkan Putera Ketiga menikmati
saat kemenangannya.

139
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,850
Usah bimbang, Puan.

140
00:06:55,850 --> 00:06:56,760
Kami akan uruskan hal di sini.

141
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:57,470
Mari pergi.

142
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,240
Menuju ke kuil peringatan.

143
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,800
Kau memperdayakan beta!

144
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,200
Muslihat itu lumrah dalam perang.

145
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,950
Jika perkara itu pun Tuanku tidak tahu,

146
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:09,640
bagaimana hendak memimpin tentera?

147
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,320
Oh.

148
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:13,240
Patik hampir terlupa.

149
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:14,710
Jasa ketenteraan Tuanku

150
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,710
sebenarnya direka-reka sejak awal lagi.

151
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:19,200
Kau fikir boleh memfitnah beta
dengan tuduhan tidak berasas?

152
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,030
Tidakkah kau takut

153
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,830
beta dakwa kau memfitnah putera raja?

154
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:22,760
Lima tahun yang lalu,

155
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,600
Tuanku telah menculik secara paksa

156
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,910
15 gadis penari
dari Pavilion Wangyue.

157
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,830
Tuanku berhasrat meracuni mereka

158
00:07:27,830 --> 00:07:28,880
lalu menyerahkan mereka kepada musuh.

159
00:07:29,390 --> 00:07:31,770
Ibu bapa patik tidak sanggup melihat
orang tidak bersalah dibunuh,

160
00:07:31,770 --> 00:07:32,510
lalu mereka cuba menghalang Tuanku.

161
00:07:32,510 --> 00:07:33,560
Kerana itulah Tuanku membunuh mereka.

162
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,270
Kemudian Tuanku memfitnah mereka

163
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,560
mengingkari perintah tentera.

164
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,390
Benarkah perkara itu pernah berlaku?

165
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:40,710
Dan dia masih tergamak
membina kuil peringatan?

166
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,100
Pernah kudengar ada khabar angin
ketika itu.

167
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,370
Kukira orang sengaja dengki
terhadap Putera Ketiga.

168
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,360
Rupanya semua itu benar belaka.

169
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,510
Daripada 15 orang gadis penari itu,

170
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,680
hanya tujuh orang yang terselamat.

171
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,200
Kerana takut rahsia terbongkar,

172
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:51,680
Tuanku menghantar orang memburu mereka.

173
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:52,880
Namun apa yang Tuanku tidak ketahui

174
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,830
(Laporan Bedah Siasat)
adalah patik belajar menjadi penyiasat mayat

175
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:57,800
semata-mata

176
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:00,080
demi membela nasib orang yang telah mati.

177
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:01,310
Setiap kekejaman

178
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:03,000
yang Tuanku lakukan pada wanita-wanita itu

179
00:08:03,310 --> 00:08:04,950
meninggalkan kesan pada tubuh mereka.

180
00:08:07,430 --> 00:08:08,270
Dan bukti-bukti fizikal itulah

181
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,240
menjadi saksi kejahatan Tuanku.

182
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:13,950
Nampaknya Putera Ketiga

183
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:15,070
tidak mampu menafikannya lagi kali ini.

184
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:15,590
Tepat sekali.

185
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,080
Sekarang keadaan semakin menarik.

186
00:08:19,870 --> 00:08:20,880
Segala omongan hasil bedah siasat ini

187
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,590
hanyalah rekaan semata-mata.

188
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:24,030
Bagaimana itu boleh dikira bukti?

189
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,270
Kau fikir sehelai kertas tidak berguna
mampu menjatuhkan beta?

190
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:27,560
Bermimpilah!

191
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,800
Masih enggan mengaku salah?

192
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:33,320
Tuanku memang tidak akan tunduk
selagi belum melihat buktinya.

193
00:08:33,550 --> 00:08:34,520
Jika begitu,

194
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,870
pada hari ini,

195
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:37,800
Tuanku pasti menerima
bukti yang Tuanku inginkan.

196
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,630
Putera Ketiga.

197
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,400
Sudah sekian lama.

198
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,630
Yue pernah berkata

199
00:09:02,150 --> 00:09:03,560
segala perbuatanmu

200
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,080
suatu hari nanti

201
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:08,080
bakal dihina
oleh seluruh dunia.

202
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,120
Akulah satu-satunya

203
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,950
penari terselamat dari Pavilion Wangyue.

204
00:09:16,510 --> 00:09:18,230
Aku juga saksi hidup tunggal

205
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,740
yang tahu kebenaran

206
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:20,920
tentang Genting Qiyun.

207
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:22,630
Marquis dan isterinya

208
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:24,680
tak pernah ingkari perintah tentera.

209
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,750
Mereka melindungi kami

210
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:29,440
apabila Putera Ketiga
menikam mereka sampai mati.

211
00:09:29,930 --> 00:09:31,010
Membunuh jeneral
tanpa sebab ketika perang

212
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,110
adalah satu penderhakaan!

213
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,470
Lihatlah itu.

214
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:35,140
Lebih baik ubah kuilnya
menjadi tugu peringatan si mati.

215
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:38,670
Inilah surat pengakuan berdarah

216
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:39,990
oleh semua wanita yang menderita.

217
00:09:43,150 --> 00:09:44,440
Setiap coretan

218
00:09:46,030 --> 00:09:47,400
ialah bukti jenayahmu.

219
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:52,110
Putera Ketiga yang disanjung hari ini

220
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,400
berlumuran darah

221
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:55,680
semua saudariku di tangannya,

222
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:56,710
termasuklah

223
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:59,920
darah
Marquis Jingyuan dan isterinya,

224
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:03,440
serta perajurit di seluruh negeri!

225
00:10:06,410 --> 00:10:07,380
Dia menyebarkan dusta
untuk memperdaya rakyat!

226
00:10:08,910 --> 00:10:09,990
Dia menyebarkan dusta
untuk memperdaya rakyat!

227
00:10:12,150 --> 00:10:13,990
Kau anggap kata-kata wanita penghibur

228
00:10:14,750 --> 00:10:15,560
sebagai bukti?

229
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,950
Memalsukan bukti

230
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,590
dan memfitnah putera raja!

231
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:23,990
Pengawal!

232
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,230
Tangkap mereka semua!

233
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:27,270
Titah diraja sudah tiba!

234
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:27,750
Dah terlambat.

235
00:10:28,910 --> 00:10:30,150
Baginda sudah tahu

236
00:10:30,150 --> 00:10:31,920
seluruh kebenaran Genting Qiyun.

237
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,230
Demi Mandat Syurga,

238
00:10:47,510 --> 00:10:48,830
Baginda bertitah.

239
00:10:49,270 --> 00:10:51,350
Putera Ketiga memalsukan
kejayaan tentera,

240
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,800
meracuni orang tak bersalah,

241
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:54,350
dan memfitnah pembesar setia.

242
00:10:54,630 --> 00:10:55,870
Dosanya tidak terampun.

243
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:57,510
Berkuat kuasa serta-merta,

244
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:58,750
gelarannya dilucutkan

245
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,160
dan dipenjarakan di penjara diraja.

246
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:03,870
Kenapa?

247
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:07,440
Saudari...

248
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:08,200
- Bagus!
- Bagus!

249
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:08,550
Tidak!

250
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:10,110
Kalian lihat ini?

251
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,270
- Bagus!
- Bagus!

252
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:12,470
- Saudari...
- Bagus! Padan mukanya!

253
00:11:13,390 --> 00:11:14,040
Kebenaran

254
00:11:15,450 --> 00:11:17,040
akhirnya terbongkar.

255
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:18,280
Bonda.

256
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,350
Ayahanda.

257
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,560
Orang yang membunuh kalian

258
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:29,200
akhirnya menerima
balasan yang setimpal.

259
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:45,950
Ayahanda.

260
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:49,320
Bonda.

261
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:55,400
Kami berjaya.

262
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:12,560
♪Tak kira bagaimana
dunia berubah esok hari♪

263
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:19,760
♪Saat ini, ku hanya mahu
berada di sisimu♪

264
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:24,960
♪Biar kucupan dan mimpi ini
kekal hingga kita menua♪

265
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:31,200
♪Dan genggam segala
kelembutan saat ini♪

266
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:37,640
♪Mengikut degupan hati ini,
kita susuri langkah kembali♪

267
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:44,120
♪Seiring waktu berlalu,
hanya renunganmu kuperlu♪

268
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:48,760
♪Satu mimpi hingga memutih rambut kita♪

269
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:10,880
♪Satu impian hingga rambut memutih♪

